  "core_idea": "**Anywhere** means any place at all: in questions and negative sentences it is about any possible place, and in positive sentences it means that the place does not matter.",
  "senses": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "signpost": "questions, negatives",
      "definition": "in, at, or to any place",
      "explanation": "In this sense it is used mainly in questions, in negative sentences, and after **if**. In a positive statement about one place that is not known, **somewhere** is usual: *I left them somewhere*.",
